# A color word in a keyword ability is a word of the text (CR 612.2): Sleight of Mind replaces "black" with "red" in Bot2's
# White Knight's "Protection from black" (CR 612.1, layer 3, before layer 6). Before it, Bot1's Cut Down (black) can't
# target the Knight (CR 702.16b), while Lightning Bolt could; after it, the Knight has protection from red - the Bolt is
# refused - and Cut Down destroys it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island
Cut Down
Lightning Bolt
Sleight of Mind
Mox Ruby
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
White Knight
Plains x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.White Knight.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.White Knight.ProtectionFrom = Black
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Cut Down.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.White Knight)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sleight of Mind.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.White Knight)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Colors(Black)
Bot1.Colors(Red)
? Bot2.Battlefield.White Knight.ProtectionFrom = Red
! Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.White Knight)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cut Down.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.White Knight)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Cut Down; Sleight of Mind
Bot1.Hand = Lightning Bolt; Island
Bot2.Graveyard = White Knight
